Subject: [PATCH] DV GL: native output and AI queue hooks in the VAAPI GL renderer

Port the GLES VAAPI renderer's DV hooks to the GL one: DMA-BUF bridge
layers from VAAPI surfaces, render buffer counts for the HDR10 AI queue
and the orientation the bridge supports.

